WEBVTT

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.493
Hi, friends. Gani here. This is Disappointment Reset.

00:00:12.493 --> 00:00:16.985
Sit tall in your chair. Feet flat on the floor.

00:00:16.985 --> 00:00:19.681
Hands resting on your desk. Shoulders soft.

00:00:19.681 --> 00:00:22.377
Take one slow breath with me… and let it go.

00:00:22.377 --> 00:00:30.463
Sometimes something we hoped for doesn't happen. A game is lost. A plan changes.

00:00:30.463 --> 00:00:38.550
Maybe you weren't picked, or the trip got rained out, or the day went differently.

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:43.941
That heavy, drooping feeling has a name. It is called disappointment.

00:00:43.941 --> 00:00:47.536
You can sit with this with eyes closed, or eyes open, looking softly at your desk.

00:00:47.536 --> 00:00:56.521
If there is a disappointment sitting in your mind right now, let it be there for a moment.

00:00:56.521 --> 00:01:02.811
You do not have to push it away, and you do not have to fix it fast.

00:01:02.811 --> 00:01:10.897
Disappointment makes sense. It means you cared about something. Caring is good.

00:01:10.897 --> 00:01:19.883
Say its name in your mind: I feel disappointed. Naming it is enough for now.

00:01:19.883 --> 00:01:29.767
Now take one slow breath with me… and let it go, soft and easy.

00:01:29.767 --> 00:01:35.158
The hoped-for thing did not happen. That is true. And the day is still going.

00:01:35.158 --> 00:01:41.448
Choose one small next thing: a drink of water, a kind word, the next page, the next game.

00:01:41.448 --> 00:01:46.839
Just one small thing. That is the reset: a gentle start, not a pretend one.

00:01:46.839 --> 00:01:53.129
The disappointment can stay a little while. And you can still take your next small step.

00:01:53.129 --> 00:02:00.317
That is Disappointment Reset. Name it, breathe, and choose one small next thing.

00:02:00.317 --> 00:02:03.013
Hands down. One more slow breath… and let it go.

00:02:03.013 --> 00:02:06.607
Eyes open. Look around your classroom.

00:02:06.607 --> 00:02:10.201
You're ready for what's next.
